# docs/design/mailbox-runtimes.md A3) records presence as mcp:<server pid>:<its start time>. Such a row counts as
# using its project by itself, while that very server process runs, for this long after its last agenthub tool call
# (one that only initialized: CONVERSATION_WAIT_MIN)
MCP_PRESENCE_MIN = int(_MB.get("mcp_presence_min", 30))
# while it does, a request/question to the project not yet delivered to any session is held, at most this long from
